{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0104_1000_039kon", "source_sha256": "172961eb8ad78c3e47d3c87f9dae5933d71c4e3da88e22bca1e20bbfdf612675", "ja": "ハァ……このあでやかさ……。\n私の魅力に、ますます磨きがかかりそうね♪", "zh": "呼……如此美艳动人……\n似乎能让我的魅力更上一层楼呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0104_1001_p", "source_sha256": "40aaa627a5ecf8d0a48ab573277f611d343d81172613d9340dc3961c2a90af5b", "ja": "このみさん、お疲れさまです。\n……何か、いい事でもありましたか？", "zh": "木实，工作辛苦了。\n……发生什么好事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
