{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0104_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "b42d37e79cf91037889b2de5c8afe3226823a50e169f293b72eee652cdf5203d", "ja": "今回もらった衣装、とっても素敵だわ。\n私、すごく気に入っちゃった。ありがとう！", "zh": "这次拿到的服装非常美丽，\n我真的好喜欢，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0104_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bbf02cd030e7dbc297da88fd01b53193ee8a2fa95ef61faf437237e7fb408898", "ja": "それならよかった。ブログに載せた写真も、\nファンの人達に好評ですよ。", "zh": "那就好。\n发到部落格的照片也在粉丝间大获好评喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0104_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "3fc6714c1c0196b1426d9e4089a1ad01061bf2fc511f3336289c2286c4f33b13", "ja": "鶴の恩返しをモチーフにした衣装って聞いたときは、\nどうなるのか想像がつかなかったけど……。", "zh": "听说设计灵感来自白鹤报恩的时候，\n我根本无法想像会是什么样的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0104_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "eecd84d73ad82e86840c522ec5d83d1e8ba9cf283acf556236b28a4c99351016", "ja": "風情があって、優美で……この衣装は、私みたいな\n大人の女性でなくちゃ、なかなか着こなせないわよね！", "zh": "结果却十分风雅而优美……如果不是像我这样\n成熟的女性，很难驾驭这套服装呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0104_1007_p", "source_sha256": "df033c027797c9a32bd393c74b648e37c33dc233dfbdcb77e9e4fe2f61c759b3", "ja": "そうですね。このみさんに、\nとてもよく似合っていると思います。", "zh": "是啊，\n我觉得非常适合木实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0104_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "ecf40a3d34a7144706e5a68cce48f4fbb906263cc09db7733f1307d95a310ba9", "ja": "ウフフ、ありがとう！　けど、こんなにアダルティな\n鶴で、本当に大丈夫？　ちょっとセクシーすぎない？", "zh": "呵呵呵，谢谢你！不过，白鹤这么成熟真的没问题吗？\n会不会有点太性感了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0104_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c7b9710f7564550863cf4c4e7f1d83cd4de77433226b43ed788edfadd6add33c", "ja": "え？　ああ、それは……。", "zh": "咦？啊，这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0104_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "7f6ae5017eb2fe12f710b3ca8db6af493d0690f08e0d7fb0218c25e1c832eb13", "ja": "{$P$}も、目のやり場に\n困っちゃうわよね。セクシーすぎるって罪だわ……。", "zh": "{$P$}也不知道要看哪里才好吧。\n太过性感也是种罪过呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0104_1011_p", "source_sha256": "34d72afb1b9862a5573da4cf7af1eb0f1e4c4bf65697e1a2dd9f4fc5131e5aa8", "ja": "そ、そうですね……。", "zh": "说、说得也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0104_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "195e9457090231c601ceb4b89cfe4ed649af07a0824f2e2d48d6dfb473615d57", "ja": "やだ、{$P$}ったら、本当に\n目をそらさなくてもいいのよ？　純真なんだから♪", "zh": "讨厌，{$P$}真是的，\n你不用真的移开目光啊。你好纯真喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
