{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0104_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "a4d4771529170edd76d74acdf152c1ae8c5ad2cd1c16d3389ec1b27bbe0897be", "ja": "この姿を見たら……相手が翁や嫗でも、青年でも、\n別れが辛くなっちゃうかもしれないわね。", "zh": "看见这身打扮……不管是老公公、老婆婆还是青年，\n也许都会为离别而痛彻心扉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0104_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a9449e48bbcb4e853c60f81253899b2469ab8bc93c07305ed0453d5658c72acc", "ja": "お別れの時、ですか……。", "zh": "离别的时候啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
